---
<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-900 via-slate-900 to-indigo-950 text-white py-16 px-4 border-y border-blue-800/40">
  <!-- Glowing Background Orbs -->
  <div class="absolute -top-24 -left-24 w-96 h-96 bg-cyan-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute -bottom-24 -right-24 w-96 h-96 bg-blue-600/15 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="space-y-4 text-center lg:text-left max-w-2xl">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-500/10 border border-red-500/30 text-red-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-red-500 animate-ping"></span>
        Dépannage d'urgence 24/7 à Arlon
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white">
        Une fuite d'eau ou une panne de chauffage impromptue ?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-base leading-relaxed">
        Nos plombiers chauffagistes certifiés interviennent en <strong class="text-cyan-400 font-semibold">moins de 30 minutes</strong> à Arlon, Messancy, Aubange, Attert et environs. Devis clair avant intervention.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-4 w-full sm:w-auto shrink-0">
      <a
        href="tel:+3263998877"
        class="w-full sm:w-auto bg-gradient-to-r from-red-600 to-rose-600 hover:from-red-500 hover:to-rose-500 text-white font-extrabold text-lg px-8 py-4 rounded-2xl shadow-xl shadow-red-600/30 hover:scale-105 transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-3 border border-red-400/30"
      >
        <svg class="w-6 h-6 animate-pulse" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z"></path>
        </svg>
        <span>+32 63 99 88 77</span>
      </a>

      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="w-full sm:w-auto bg-slate-800/90 hover:bg-slate-800 text-slate-100 font-bold text-base px-6 py-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-700 hover:border-slate-600 transition-all text-center"
      >
        Demander un devis gratuit
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
